{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">飲食節目《在家宴客60道菜》中，許美德師傅親自示範了一道鮮味十足的「頭水紫菜燴肉丸煲」！這道佳餚不僅教大家自製精緻的金菇南瓜卷，更有秘訣製作出鬆化不散的手剁肉丸。配合鮮甜的頭水紫菜，輕鬆燴煮出湯清味美的宴客大菜。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>食材</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a63ce146-4e37-4d34-a76a-5e0fcfb24168.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026SeeULBtkBS1791194105.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a63ce146-4e37-4d34-a76a-5e0fcfb24168.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c6973f62-4a8a-4c06-9018-18d6bf98b35b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026LnFm0dYtGX1791194105.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c6973f62-4a8a-4c06-9018-18d6bf98b35b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>大廚貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li